  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the imminent danger foreboding conveyed by the visual and textual elements",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall sense of impending violence and danger created by the combination of the visual material (person carrying homemade explosives, armed individuals in background) and the textual material ('shits about to get real'). The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the meme's framing invites the user to identify with the anticipated outcome or the escalating tension, making the user a passive recipient of the foreboding message. The projection is onto the scene and its textual overlay, which collectively evoke a psychological response of alarm or anticipation of disaster.",
